      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The single primary action; mint-to-indigo gradient with resting mint glow.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-btn-primary\" href=\"#\">View Projects →</a>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:#0a0e17;--bg3:#1a2236;--accent:#6ee7b7;--accent2:#818cf8;--glow:rgba(110,231,183,0.25);--text:#e2e8f0;--text2:#94a3b8;--bright:#f8fafc;--border:rgba(148,163,184,0.12);}.ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 30px;border-radius:14px;font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0e17;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));box-shadow:0 4px 20px var(--glow);transition:all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);}.ds-btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px var(--glow);}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
