      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": null,
      "description": "Fixed glass bar with mono logo and underline-grow links.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-logo\" href=\"#\">Kai-Chin<span>Huang</span></a><div class=\"ds-links\"><a href=\"#\">Experience</a><a href=\"#\">Projects</a><a href=\"#\">Skills</a></div></nav>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:#0a0e17;--bg3:#1a2236;--accent:#6ee7b7;--accent2:#818cf8;--glow:rgba(110,231,183,0.25);--text:#e2e8f0;--text2:#94a3b8;--bright:#f8fafc;--border:rgba(148,163,184,0.12);}.ds-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 28px;background:rgba(10,14,23,0.75);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(1.4);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}.ds-logo{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:-1px;text-decoration:none;}.ds-logo span{color:var(--accent2);}.ds-links{display:flex;gap:36px;}.ds-links a{position:relative;color:var(--text2);font-family:Sora,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:0.9rem;letter-spacing:0.02em;text-decoration:none;transition:color 0.3s;}.ds-links a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-6px;left:0;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px;transition:width 0.3s;}.ds-links a:hover{color:var(--bright);}.ds-links a:hover::after{width:100%;}"
    },
    {
